  <wpt lat="46.656232" lon="-80.882479">
    <name>Hanmer Home Base (Start)</name>
    <desc>Expedition departure point (4671 Dupuis Drive, Hanmer, ON). Full 87 &amp; 91 fuel tanks.</desc>
