  <wpt lat="48.154200" lon="-69.697500">
    <name>Phare du Moulin-à-Baude (Tadoussac)</name>
    <desc>Historic red-and-white coastal beacon perched above the St. Lawrence estuary and Saguenay Fjord confluence; world-class beluga whale lookout.</desc>
